recommend keep-going the ascii_comment red is closed and four roster reds stand: rule_twin is custody gate %7, two are Pond on a macOS bench, and dated_path at 335/168 is the one left in reach. The REDS capacity deadlock (%338) still wants his seat, and the card now sits 18 bytes under its own bound.
